weed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> رَسُولَهُمْ فَهُمْ لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>ِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٩</span>","End":"٦٩","PageNumber":346,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":298,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":70,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ يَقُولُونَ بِهِۦ جِنَّةُۢۚ بَلۡ جَآءَهُم بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَأَكۡثَرُهُمۡ لِلۡحَقِّ كَٰرِهُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> جِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=iqlab>ةُۢ‌ۚ ب</tajweed>َلْ ج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقِّ وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ لِلْحَقِّ كَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رِه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٠</span>","End":"٧٠","PageNumber":346,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":298,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":71,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَوِ ٱتَّبَعَ ٱلۡحَقُّ أَهۡوَآءَهُمۡ لَفَسَدَتِ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتُ وَٱلۡأَرۡضُ وَمَن فِيهِنَّۚ بَلۡ أَتَيۡنَٰهُم بِذِكۡرِهِمۡ فَهُمۡ عَن ذِكۡرِهِم مُّعۡرِضُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَوِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّبَعَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقُّ أَهْو<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَهُمْ لَفَسَدَتِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تُ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضُ وَمَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>ِيهِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ‌ۚ بَلْ أَتَيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِذِكْرِهِمْ فَهُمْ عَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ذ</tajweed>ِكْرِه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ِم م</tajweed>ُّعْرِض<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧١</span>","End":"٧١","PageNumber":346,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":298,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":72,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ تَسۡـَٔلُهُمۡ خَرۡجٗا فَخَرَاجُ رَبِّكَ خَيۡرٞۖ وَهُوَ خَيۡرُ ٱلرَّـٰزِقِينَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ تَسْــَٔلُهُمْ خَرْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>جًا ف</tajweed>َخَرَاجُ رَبِّكَ خَيْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ‌ۖ و</tajweed>َهُوَ خَيْرُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>زِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٢</span>","End":"٧٢","PageNumber":346,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":298,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":73,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِنَّكَ لَتَدۡعُوهُمۡ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٖ مُّسۡتَقِيمٖ","TajweedText":"وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ لَتَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>عُوهُمْ إِلَىٰ صِر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>طٍ م</tajweed>ُّسْتَق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٍ <span class=end>٧٣</span>","End":"٧٣","PageNumber":346,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":298,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":74,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤۡمِنُونَ بِٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ عَنِ ٱلصِّرَٰطِ لَنَٰكِبُونَ","TajweedText":"وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخِرَةِ عَنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiya